 number of combinations of $n$ objects taken $r$ at a time is given by the formula\n\n$$\n{}_{n}{C}_{r}=\\frac{n!}{(n-r)!\\,r!}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting $n=5$ and $r=1,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{}_{5}{C}_{1} & =\\frac{5!}{(5-1)!1!} \\\\  & =\\frac{5!}{4!1!} \\\\  & =\\frac{5\\cdot \\cancel{4!}}{\\cancel{4!}\\cdot 1} \\\\  & =5.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-122495/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b6b720d4-59b0-5d86-b856-ff69abfe4152"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-122495"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-84956/selection/a5bcf5044d7131cdf0d721e80125a87ad3d00df1e947910bf38c9dd3889981de" :answer/id #uuid "89a11eec-c806-5a47-a33b-d1913d6face8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "81" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-84956/selection/303632d9519e4b7e53f9af56aad03bb866b8b5ede58a0b8b2cb848d575460c53" :answer/id #uuid "cf50ae98-cb3f-5c1d-b654-1026d082243e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "9" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-84956/selection/842947b00d8ffc5745884eed061ea57d57affe318d15d13be5c3612b41e13326" :answer/id #uuid "38a27b8b-cb25-51b9-9bb7-3f233461176e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "84" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-84956/selection/c9ec5d6cdf4e67c7f8bce68475bed400e56bf403f3d09b5928f78b6baa512eab" :answer/id #uuid "cf725ea0-20e7-5b0b-8876-02eddfcf6872" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "27" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-84956/selection/f1c9a73078cb2996ecfc62c940e8a02ddff429538e03df68ec9b668d318b2ed9" :answer/id #uuid "2f308437-e4f3-5020-9529-eae778a6bb18" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "243" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-84956/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "95697ef1-2f10-5eed-893d-aa716ed6890e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-84956/selection/842947b00d8f